  Local fs_0_2  // the array walked
  Local fi_0_20  // the position in the array walked
  Local fv_0_20  // the element walked
  Local fbg_0_0  // the inner array of an expand
  Local fj_0_0  // the position in the inner array of an expand
  Local fo_0_20  // the result of the chain
  Local fi_0_21  // the position in the array walked
